  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#applicable_safety_measures001">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Applicable_safety_measures"/>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:account_with_actions_as rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#applicable_safety_measures001"/>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Check>The applicable security measures must control the risk to the data.</OntologiaLOPDP:Check>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Excess_of_authorization>The applicable security measures must prevent the authorization process in the data.</OntologiaLOPDP:Excess_of_authorization>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>Concrete actions that the responsible and in charge must take into consideration at the moment of a change or mishandling of the data of the owner of the information.</OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Mitigate>The applicable security measures must mitigate the risk to the data.</OntologiaLOPDP:Mitigate>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Not_authorized>The applicable security measures must prevent unauthorized access to the data.</OntologiaLOPDP:Not_authorized>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Prevent>The applicable security measures must prevent the risk to the data.</OntologiaLOPDP:Prevent>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Reduce>The applicable security measures must reduce the risk to the data.</OntologiaLOPDP:Reduce>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Secrecy_of_communications>The applicable security measures must be governed by the secrecy of data communications.</OntologiaLOPDP:Secrecy_of_communications>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Stop>The applicable security measures must prevent data compromise</OntologiaLOPDP:Stop>
  </rdf:Description>
