  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#infringements001">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Violations_in_verification"/>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:the_verification_covers_aspects_such_as rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#infringements001"/>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Detail_of_investigation_of_infringements>Detailed information on violations</OntologiaLOPDP:Detail_of_investigation_of_infringements>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Penalties_for_mild_infractions>In the case of the Data Authority, the range is from 1 to 10 unified basic salaries; other members of the law are not considered.</OntologiaLOPDP:Penalties_for_mild_infractions>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Penalties_for_serious_infractions>In the case of the Data Authority, the range is 10 to 20 unified basic salaries; the other members of the law are not considered.</OntologiaLOPDP:Penalties_for_serious_infractions>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Very_serious>Infringements that must be treated specially according to the seriousness of the infringement.</OntologiaLOPDP:Very_serious>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Violations_in_verification>Fines for non-compliance with the law vary according to the degree of non-compliance.</OntologiaLOPDP:Violations_in_verification>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#principios_de_confidencialidad001">
