    <OntologiaLOPDP:segmented_into_the_following_national_cases rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#solve_an_urgence001"/>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Anonymization>A nationwide transfer can be forced when an emergency is expected to be solved and must be anonymous.</OntologiaLOPDP:Anonymization>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Exceptions>A transfer can be forced at the national level when an emergency is expected to be solved</OntologiaLOPDP:Exceptions>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>This exception indicates that in the event of a vital emergency, the owner's data may be used without the owner's consent.</OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>
  </rdf:Description>
