  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#violation_investigation001">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Infringement_investigation"/>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:segmented_into_the_following_international_cases rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#violation_investigation001"/>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Detail_of_investigation_of_infringements>If the data subject has breach information, he/she is subject to an international exception on his/her data.</OntologiaLOPDP:Detail_of_investigation_of_infringements>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>When the owner of the information has committed an offense or committed a crime, this information may be investigated without the owner's consent.</OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#legal_institutions001">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Legal_institutions"/>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:segmented_into_the_following_international_cases rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#legal_institutions001"/>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>Las instituciones legales pueden hacer uso de los datos del titular en procesos de investigación sin el consentimiento de este último.</OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Legal_institutions_detail>In the event that a legal institution requests legal action on the data in an international transfer, it may do so.</OntologiaLOPDP:Legal_institutions_detail>
  </rdf:Description>
