    <OntologiaLOPDP:Disposal>It must be possible to delete financial data</OntologiaLOPDP:Disposal>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>Momentary data that involves additional information such as account statements.</OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>When the objective is to process the data for specific purposes, whether historical, statistical or scientific.</OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Updated>It must be possible to update financial data</OntologiaLOPDP:Updated>
  </rdf:Description>
