  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#data_people_over_age_001">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Data_Seniors_data"/>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:and_the_owner_divides_into rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#data_people_over_age_001"/>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Access>Data must be accessible</OntologiaLOPDP:Access>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Accidental_or_illegal_destruction_or_communication>Data must not be subject to intentional or accidental destruction.</OntologiaLOPDP:Accidental_or_illegal_destruction_or_communication>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Advise>The data must be available for consultation</OntologiaLOPDP:Advise>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Advise_on_risk_analysis>The delegate provides risk analysis advice to the data authority.</OntologiaLOPDP:Advise_on_risk_analysis>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Alterations>Data are prone to alterations, this should be avoided.</OntologiaLOPDP:Alterations>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Anonymization>Data must be anonymized</OntologiaLOPDP:Anonymization>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Audit>Data must be auditable</OntologiaLOPDP:Audit>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Check>The risks present in the data must be controlled</OntologiaLOPDP:Check>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Control_systemized_and_stabilized_control>Permanent control of the data must be carried out</OntologiaLOPDP:Control_systemized_and_stabilized_control>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Cooperate_with_the_Personal_Data_Protection_Authority>The data is subject to cooperation between members of the law enforcement community.</OntologiaLOPDP:Cooperate_with_the_Personal_Data_Protection_Authority>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Correct>The risks present in the data must be corrected</OntologiaLOPDP:Correct>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Correction>It must be possible to rectify the data</OntologiaLOPDP:Correction>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Delegate_functions>Some data are manipulated by the delegate</OntologiaLOPDP:Delegate_functions>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Details_of_the_law_details>The data are present in the members of the law.</OntologiaLOPDP:Details_of_the_law_details>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Disposal>It must be possible to delete data</OntologiaLOPDP:Disposal>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>These are data subjects over 18 years of age who do not need the permission of another person in order to use their data.</OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Impact_assessment>The impact of the data must be assessed</OntologiaLOPDP:Impact_assessment>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Large_scale_treatment>Large-scale data analysis is required</OntologiaLOPDP:Large_scale_treatment>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Loss>Prevent data loss</OntologiaLOPDP:Loss>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Mitigate>Data risks must be mitigated</OntologiaLOPDP:Mitigate>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Mitigate>Mitigating data risks</OntologiaLOPDP:Mitigate>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Name>Holder's name</OntologiaLOPDP:Name>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Name>The name of the owner of the data must be known.</OntologiaLOPDP:Name>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:National_registry_for_the_protection_of_personal_data>Data must be in a national registry</OntologiaLOPDP:National_registry_for_the_protection_of_personal_data>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Nature>The nature of the data must be known</OntologiaLOPDP:Nature>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Nature_of_the_data>The nature of the data must be known</OntologiaLOPDP:Nature_of_the_data>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Organizational>Organizational data exist; they are data from organizations</OntologiaLOPDP:Organizational>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Personal_data_encryption>The owner of the data has the option to encrypt his data</OntologiaLOPDP:Personal_data_encryption>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Personal_data_security_details>Data must be secure</OntologiaLOPDP:Personal_data_security_details>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Personal_detail>The data stores in detail the holder's information.</OntologiaLOPDP:Personal_detail>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Personal_information>Personal information of the data subject</OntologiaLOPDP:Personal_information>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Prevent>Data risks must be prevented</OntologiaLOPDP:Prevent>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Purpose>The purpose of the data must be defined</OntologiaLOPDP:Purpose>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Reduce>Reduce data risks</OntologiaLOPDP:Reduce>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Risk>Data should avoid being subject to risk</OntologiaLOPDP:Risk>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Sanctioning_administrative_procedure>The manipulated data are subject to an administrative sanctioning process.</OntologiaLOPDP:Sanctioning_administrative_procedure>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Scope>Data must have a defined scope of use</OntologiaLOPDP:Scope>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Secrecy_of_communications>Data must be subject to secrecy in communications</OntologiaLOPDP:Secrecy_of_communications>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Security_notification_of_infringement>The data owner must be notified in the event of a breach of data security.</OntologiaLOPDP:Security_notification_of_infringement>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Serious>Holder data may be subject to serious infringement</OntologiaLOPDP:Serious>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Seudonomización>The data must be treated in such a way that it is not known who the owner is in case of loss of data.</OntologiaLOPDP:Seudonomización>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Slight>Holder's data may be subject to minor violations.</OntologiaLOPDP:Slight>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Stop>Preventing data from misuse</OntologiaLOPDP:Stop>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Supervise>Holder data must be monitored</OntologiaLOPDP:Supervise>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Supervise>The data are supervised by the data delegate.</OntologiaLOPDP:Supervise>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Systematic_evaluation>A semantic evaluation must be performed</OntologiaLOPDP:Systematic_evaluation>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Technical_measurements>Technical measures must be taken with the data</OntologiaLOPDP:Technical_measurements>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Threat>Data are subject to threats</OntologiaLOPDP:Threat>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Updated>The data must be up to date</OntologiaLOPDP:Updated>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Very_serious>The holder's data may be subject to very serious infringements</OntologiaLOPDP:Very_serious>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Volume>The volume of data must be known</OntologiaLOPDP:Volume>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Vulnerabilidad>The data is exposed to vulnerabilities</OntologiaLOPDP:Vulnerabilidad>
  </rdf:Description>
