    <OntologiaLOPDP:Exceptions>It has exceptions at the national level that apply</OntologiaLOPDP:Exceptions>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Historical>If it is a historical issue, the information can be used for the following purposes</OntologiaLOPDP:Historical>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Scientist>If it is a scientific topic, it is possible to use the information</OntologiaLOPDP:Scientist>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Statistician>If it is a statistical issue, it is possible to use the information</OntologiaLOPDP:Statistician>
