    <OntologiaLOPDP:Detail_transfer_domestic_domestic_scope>Information on the rules to be followed to make a transfer at national level</OntologiaLOPDP:Detail_transfer_domestic_domestic_scope>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>These are all national considerations for a national transfer.</OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>
  </rdf:Description>
