    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Clarity_and_accuracy"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:nodeID="N17ce7098530b4cba9ff4acbf962dedee"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#right_to_the_information001">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Right_to_information_in_verification"/>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:can_be_rights_of rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#right_to_the_information001"/>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Consent_in_verification>Must be consented to by the owner</OntologiaLOPDP:Consent_in_verification>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Data_use>The owner's data must be free from use in information automation processes, in order to avoid automated decisions on any specific subject.</OntologiaLOPDP:Data_use>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>This right means that the owner of the data must know what is going to be done with them and how they are going to be treated either in the field of data processing or in the field of transfer of information, and to complete this task there is a period of 30 days.</OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Informed>Puede ser un consentimiento informado</OntologiaLOPDP:Informed>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Not_informed>May be an uninformed consent</OntologiaLOPDP:Not_informed>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Preservation_time>It has 30 days to inform the holder that his data was obtained in a non-direct way, this is done by the responsible and in charge.</OntologiaLOPDP:Preservation_time>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Revoke_consent>It must be possible to revoke the consent at any time, this can be done by the owner of the data.</OntologiaLOPDP:Revoke_consent>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Updated>The information must be up to date</OntologiaLOPDP:Updated>
  </rdf:Description>
