    <OntologiaLOPDP:Applied>When the verification process is applied</OntologiaLOPDP:Applied>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Cessation_of_treatment>When the corrective action stops</OntologiaLOPDP:Cessation_of_treatment>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>Technical corrective actions, e.g., error corrections in information transfer events.</OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Guidelines>Guidelines for a technical process</OntologiaLOPDP:Guidelines>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Guidelines>Technical guidelines</OntologiaLOPDP:Guidelines>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Not_applied>When the verification process does not apply</OntologiaLOPDP:Not_applied>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Regulations>Technical regulations</OntologiaLOPDP:Regulations>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Technical_measurements>Measures for a technical verification process</OntologiaLOPDP:Technical_measurements>
  </rdf:Description>
