  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#right_to_correct_and_update001">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Right_to_correct_and_update_in_verification"/>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:can_be_rights_of rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#right_to_correct_and_update001"/>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Consent_in_verification>Must be consented to by the owner</OntologiaLOPDP:Consent_in_verification>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>This right states that the owner of the information has the possibility to update their data when it is inaccurate or incomplete, and this must be done within 15 days.</OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Informed>It can be an informed consent</OntologiaLOPDP:Informed>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Not_informed>May be an uninformed consent</OntologiaLOPDP:Not_informed>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Preservation_time>The time is 15 days</OntologiaLOPDP:Preservation_time>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Revoke_consent>It must be possible to revoke the consent at any time, this can be done by the owner of the data.</OntologiaLOPDP:Revoke_consent>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Scope_of_credit_rights>In the credit rights it is stipulated that such rights, as well as all the rights present in the law, have the option of a rectification of information in case the holder needs it.</OntologiaLOPDP:Scope_of_credit_rights>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Updated>Must be updated</OntologiaLOPDP:Updated>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="Ned15632136844c1198d56e247ee2cca3">
