    <OntologiaLOPDP:and_in_exceptional_cases_you_have_to rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#exceptions_to_rights001"/>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>It talks about the cases in which the contemplated rights will not be applied and will be obviated.</OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>
