    <OntologiaLOPDP:Celerity>Data protection mechanisms must be speeded up</OntologiaLOPDP:Celerity>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Efficiency>Data protection mechanisms must be effective</OntologiaLOPDP:Efficiency>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Efficiency>Data protection mechanisms must be efficient</OntologiaLOPDP:Efficiency>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>Actions that must be taken into account with regard to data so that they are not violated.</OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>
