    <OntologiaLOPDP:Accidental_or_illegal_destruction_or_communication>The public sector is subject to accidental destruction or disclosure of its data.</OntologiaLOPDP:Accidental_or_illegal_destruction_or_communication>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Alterations>The public sector is subject to alterations in its data.</OntologiaLOPDP:Alterations>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>These are security actions to be considered in the public sector.</OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Loss>The public sector is subject to a loss in its data</OntologiaLOPDP:Loss>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Risk>The public sector is subject to data risk.</OntologiaLOPDP:Risk>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Secrecy_of_communications>The public sector is subject to secrecy of communications in its data.</OntologiaLOPDP:Secrecy_of_communications>
    <OntologiaLOPDP:Threat>The public sector is subject to a threat to its data</OntologiaLOPDP:Threat>
